I am tired from the move.
I need a short break.
I go into my new kitchen.
My thermos is already standing on the kitchen table.
The coffee in it is from this morning.
Next to the thermos stands a cup.
I pour the coffee.
Fortunately, it is still warm.
I take the cup in my hand.
I stand at the window.
A towel is hanging next to the window.
I look into the courtyard.
Down in the courtyard stand many bicycles.
Next to the bicycles stands a tree.
Under the tree lies a little snow.
It is cold outside.
But my new home is beautifully warm.
